<div class="ocats"><label class="small ofit"><input type="checkbox" id="ofit"<%~ it.clientGameStateOfit %>> only what fits</label><%~ it.categories %></div><p class="dim small">Outfit space <%~ it.computedShipStats %> t free · guns <%~ it.computedShipStats2 %>/<%~ it.computedShipStats3 %> · turrets <%~ it.computedShipStats4 %>/<%~ it.computedShipStats5 %> · passenger seats <%~ it.occupiedPassengerSeats %>/<%~ it.passengerSeats %></p><p class="dim small">Factory equipment is included in the hull price and sells at its factory value. Separately purchased equipment sells for half its retail price.</p><table class="tbl"><tr><th></th><th>OUTFIT</th><th>EFFECT</th><th>MASS</th><th>PRICE</th><th>OWNED</th><th></th></tr><%~ it.list %></table>